  "details": "If an user profile's bio displays a (flickering) scroll bar that is indefinitely small but scrollable, pushing the thumbstick forward on the profile to scroll up in the profile causes every line and icon to become partially cut, while the laser is focused on the profile.\n\nIt's difficult to describe, so please see the attached video for a demonstration of the glitchy effects.\n\nThis issue may be VR-only. I could not reproduce this in desktop mode when viewing the same profile.",
